  "talks": [
    {
      "slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "title": "Every Solo Agent Builder Eventually Reinvents a Worse Version of CI/CD",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8",
      "track": "",
      "day": null,
      "room": null,
      "is_sole_speaker": true
    }
  ],
  "sessions": [],
  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "If you build long enough, specially alone, you will start building something completely different. Something that looks suspiciously like CICD. Except worse, because you're building it from scratch, one failure at a time.",
      "timestamp_sec": 0,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=0s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "And the most useful thing I learned from building this was not how to build better prompts. It was recognizing the five controls I was rebuilding badly and what you can do instead.",
      "timestamp_sec": 0,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=0s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "But here's the thing that matters for this talk, not the content. What matters is that this system has seven handoffs.",
      "timestamp_sec": 49,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=49s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Every single handoff is the place where the system can lie to you. And if you're building the system alone, nobody catches the lies except you, usually after the damage is done.",
      "timestamp_sec": 99,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=99s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "One skill changes its output schema, so three skills downstream break. You decided to add a validation at the boundary because of it. You just reinvented contract testing.",
      "timestamp_sec": 144,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=144s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The reason the title says worst version isn't because agents are software builds, it's because you end up needing the exact same operational guarantees.",
      "timestamp_sec": 144,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=144s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The dangerous failure in an agent system is never a bad output. A bad output is very easy to fix.",
      "timestamp_sec": 197,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=197s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "That is the agent equivalent of shipping because the code compiled, but the tests never run.",
      "timestamp_sec": 197,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=197s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "This is why agent demos are misleading. They always show you the happy path.",
      "timestamp_sec": 298,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=298s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Claim bearing content cannot ship without a verification trail. \"Trust me\" is not a verifier.",
      "timestamp_sec": 400,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=400s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "If your agent system makes claims about data, about users, about anything, and you don't have a validation chain, you're shipping unverified assertions with a professional looking wrapper.",
      "timestamp_sec": 400,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=400s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "If your system keeps generating near duplicates, your system looks automated, even if every individual piece is technically fine. Your audience notices before you do.",
      "timestamp_sec": 455,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=455s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "That audit record is boring, but when a scheduled run fails at 2:00 a.m., the final artifact alone is not enough. You need to know which gate failed.",
      "timestamp_sec": 455,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=455s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "You don't need a platform. You don't need a framework. You don't need the ecosystem to catch up. What you need are a few boring gates.",
      "timestamp_sec": 503,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=503s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "In software, we learned not to deploy only because code exists. In agent systems, we need to learn not to ship just because the artifacts look complete.",
      "timestamp_sec": 553,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=553s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Pick the most expensive handoff. Not the most complex, most expensive. The one where bad data can cost you the most.",
      "timestamp_sec": 601,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=601s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "A gate which logs only warnings is not a gate. It's a suggestion. The gate needs to block the artifact from moving forward.",
      "timestamp_sec": 601,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=601s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "That's the difference between an impressive demo and an operable system. Before you add another agent, add one boundary.",
      "timestamp_sec": 601,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=601s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
    {
      "claim": "Agent frameworks provide none of the operational guarantees (regression testing, monitoring, contract validation, staging, audit trails) by default, so solo builders inevitably rebuild worse versions of them.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 197,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=197s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "The dangerous failure mode in agent systems is a polished artifact that looks ready, not a visibly bad output.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 197,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=197s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Handoffs between steps, not prompts or skills, are where agent systems actually corrupt data.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 99,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=99s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Typical agent demos are misleading because they only show the happy path.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 298,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=298s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Content that makes factual or numeric claims should be blocked from shipping unless those claims are traceable to a source.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 400,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=400s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "A gate that only logs warnings provides no real guarantee; gates must be able to halt the pipeline.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 601,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=601s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "You should instrument the highest-cost handoff first rather than the most technically complex one.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 601,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=601s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Solving this requires no new platform, framework, or ecosystem maturity — only a handful of simple boundary checks.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 503,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLXxTaPagA8&t=503s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Adding another agent to a system is less valuable than adding one boundary to the system you already have.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 601,
      "talk_slug": "every-solo-agent-builder-eventually-reinvents-a-worse-version-of-cicd",
